  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development does not constitute permitted development by virtue of the provisions of Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A1 (f) of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015, as the proposed extension has a total depth of 5.75m which exceeds the 4.00m depth permitted under the Article 4 Direction in place within the London Borough of Hillingdon. The proposal also fails to meet the criteria of paragraph J point (iii) of Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 by exceeding half the width of the original dwellinghouse. As such Prior Approval is refused."
